# Cloudflare Pages security headers. The site is fully static and loads no
# third-party origins, so these can be strict without breaking anything.
# (完全な静的サイトで外部オリジンを読み込まないため、強めに設定できる)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
